{"pref":29,"items":[{"id":"41861db389","name":"明日香村","page":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/asuka/asuka.html","imgs":[{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/asuka/asukamura-2.jpg","kind":"design","desc":"下記と１２時や６時、こじり穴などの仕様違いのノンカラー。 訪れた頃、付近では道路の付替え工事が行われていて、新しい道路にこの仕様の蓋が置かれたようです。まだ地が黒いです。"},{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/asuka/asuka-2.jpg","kind":"emblem","desc":"中央の明日香村章を村の花タチバナと村の木ツキ（けやき）で囲むデザイン。 「あすかむら」「おすい」の文字。"}],"point":[34.45935,135.8278],"bbox":[135.7884,34.429,135.8672,34.4897],"geom":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[135.78844,34.46726],[135.8133,34.442],[135.82636,34.44491],[135.84676,34.42896],[135.8609,34.44236],[135.86724,34.44328],[135.85619,34.46098],[135.82753,34.4812],[135.82655,34.48631],[135.81051,34.48973],[135.80825,34.47077],[135.78844,34.46726]]]]}},{"id":"be9bdda08c","name":"安堵町","page":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/anndo/anndo.html","imgs":[{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/anndo/anndo-2.jpg","kind":"emblem","desc":"ＡＳＤマンホール。 中央には町章が入っていますね。"}],"point":[34.60535,135.7544],"bbox":[135.7413,34.592,135.7675,34.6187],"geom":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[135.75694,34.61873],[135.75166,34.6074],[135.74131,34.60094],[135.74154,34.59318],[135.75163,34.59196],[135.76751,34.59713],[135.75694,34.61873]]]]}},{"id":"0609388d56","name":"斑鳩町","page":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/ikaruga/ikaruga.html","imgs":[{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/ikaruga/ikaruga.jpg","kind":"design","desc":"三重塔と竜田川とモミジ。町の花・サザンカと町の木・クロマツも描かれています。 周囲の模様は、寺の金堂の高欄に使われている万字くずしの模様。「いかるが」「げすい」の文字。 ※斑鳩町の関係部署へマンホールに描かれている仏塔は「法起寺」「法輪寺」のどちらのものか。 と問い合わせた経緯が御座います。 「特定の塔ではない」との回答でした。 町内には斑鳩三塔が建ちますね。 五重ならば「法隆寺」を想起されますが、 描かれているのは、三重と見て取れます"},{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/ikaruga/ikaruga3-2.jpg","kind":"design","desc":"町の木・黒松と町の花・さざんかのデザイン。"},{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/ikaruga/ikaruga9.jpg","kind":"emblem","desc":"蓋面の下から3分の2程が歩道面仕様で、上部に市章と「げすい」の文字。"},{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/ikaruga/ikaruga4.jpg","kind":"design","desc":"スリップしにくいデザインのマンホールも発見！！"}],"point":[34.618700000000004,135.7331],"bbox":[135.7093,34.5907,135.7569,34.6467],"geom":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[135.72158,34.64673],[135.72015,34.64649],[135.71618,34.63996],[135.71875,34.62064],[135.7099,34.60973],[135.7093,34.59896],[135.71571,34.59488],[135.72686,34.59067],[135.74154,34.59318],[135.74131,34.60094],[135.75166,34.6074],[135.75694,34.61873],[135.72607,34.63532],[135.72158,34.64673]]]]}},{"id":"a598d915fb","name":"生駒市","page":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/ikoma/ikoma.html","imgs":[{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/ikoma/ikoma.jpg","kind":"design","desc":"ポップ調の文字（IKOMA CITY）に雨傘の絵が入ってますね。 未来の都市のイメージで作った蓋だそうです。 「Ａ」の上あたりにはＵＦＯらしきものも（＾＿＾）"},{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/ikoma/ikoma4.jpg","kind":"design","desc":"こちらはＳＦか現代アート風の未来都市ですね。"},{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/ikoma/ikomasi5.jpg","kind":"design","desc":"上記デザインのノンカラーで、上部に「いこまし」「うすい」の文字。 雨水"},{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/ikoma/ikoma2.jpg","kind":"emblem","desc":"ＪＩＳ規格のマンホール。 市章は出っ張りがある側が上のようです。"}],"point":[34.712,135.7141],"bbox":[135.6711,34.6465,135.7571,34.7775],"geom":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[135.75551,34.72753],[135.75706,34.73592],[135.74636,34.74683],[135.73335,34.75478],[135.72916,34.77746],[135.70662,34.77234],[135.71019,34.75591],[135.69692,34.74141],[135.70169,34.72168],[135.68308,34.71129],[135.6734,34.70225],[135.6731,34.69015],[135.6787,34.67776],[135.6711,34.66156],[135.68592,34.66023],[135.68888,34.65487],[135.70695,34.64784],[135.72015,34.64649],[135.72158,34.64673],[135.72957,34.6586],[135.72712,34.66515],[135.71568,34.6975],[135.71935,34.70648],[135.72912,34.70986],[135.74203,34.72556],[135.75551,34.72753]]]]}},{"id":"09b9f939cd","name":"宇陀市","page":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/uda/uda.html","imgs":[{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/uda/uda.jpg","kind":"emblem","desc":"宇陀市 ・宇陀市の新市章が入った蓋。歯車の様な模様のデザイン蓋。「うだし」、「おすい」の表記も。"},{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/uda/utano.jpg","kind":"design","desc":"旧菟田野町（うたのちょう） ・一見して何のデザインか判らなかったけど、 町の木スギ、町の花アジサイ、町の鳥メジロが重ね合わされ一つの模様になっています。 「UTANO OSUI」の表示。"},{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/uda/oouda.jpg","kind":"design","desc":"上記のノンカラーで１２時６時違い。 カザグルマの北限自生地だそうです。「大宇陀町」「公共下水」の表示。"},{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/uda/haibara2.jpg","kind":"design","desc":"旧榛原町の花ヤマツツジ、町の鳥ウグイス、山は大和富士と言われる額井岳のカラーデザイン。 「はいばら」「おすい」の表記。（写真はノンカラー版）"}],"point":[34.53115,135.99695],"bbox":[135.8869,34.4271,136.107,34.6352],"geom":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[135.94612,34.5603],[135.94022,34.55041],[135.94281,34.54047],[135.92898,34.53053],[135.92929,34.52527],[135.91201,34.5186],[135.91263,34.50818],[135.89868,34.48778],[135.88687,34.4767],[135.89292,34.46267],[135.88741,34.45341],[135.89726,34.44288],[135.90663,34.44788],[135.91911,34.4449],[135.93352,34.43025],[135.945,34.42713],[135.95966,34.43623],[135.97551,34.43659],[135.99676,34.44391],[136.00714,34.44357],[136.01295,34.45353],[136.02505,34.45498],[136.04202,34.46305],[136.05387,34.47901],[136.07269,34.47713],[136.06823,34.48593],[136.08003,34.49368],[136.08602,34.50944],[136.09321,34.51667],[136.08985,34.52605],[136.10221,34.52853],[136.09775,34.54045],[136.107,34.55631],[136.08336,34.55933],[136.04977,34.58027],[136.05214,34.59306],[136.04657,34.60056],[136.06247,34.61996],[136.05074,34.62105],[136.02525,34.63524],[136.00507,34.62568],[135.99273,34.62817],[135.99959,34.61857],[135.97894,34.60239],[135.97998,34.59549],[135.96974,34.58884],[135.97805,34.58064],[135.97659,34.56533],[135.97205,34.55851],[135.94612,34.5603]]]]}},{"id":"d52f37c4a0","name":"王寺町","page":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/ouji/ouji.html","imgs":[{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/ouji/ouji4.jpg","kind":"design","desc":"種別が付けられていない鉄蓋も発見！"},{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/ouji/ouji3.jpg","kind":"design","desc":"種別が付けられていない鉄蓋も発見！（写真はノンカラー版）"},{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/ouji/ouji6.jpg","kind":"design","desc":"小型蓋もやわらぎの鐘のデザインでしたよ。"},{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/ouji/oujityou2.jpg","kind":"emblem","desc":"亀甲模様の蓋です、中央に町章、その下に「雨水」の表記11個の孔と鍵穴が下部に一つ、受枠に三重の楕円模様。"}],"point":[34.58485,135.69315],"bbox":[135.6706,34.5707,135.7157,34.599],"geom":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[135.70489,34.57377],[135.7121,34.58244],[135.71571,34.59488],[135.7093,34.59896],[135.68242,34.58546],[135.6706,34.5762],[135.67308,34.57073],[135.68088,34.57498],[135.70489,34.57377]]]]}},{"id":"37598733f2","name":"大淀町","page":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/ooyodo/ooyodo.html","imgs":[{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/ooyodo/ooyodo-2.jpg","kind":"emblem","desc":"町章の中に、特産の鮎と梨（町の花は梨の花）を描いたマンホールです。 「おおよど」「げすい」の表記。"},{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/ooyodo/ooyodo5.jpg","kind":"design","desc":"鮎と梨のデザインの小型蓋です。"},{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/ooyodo/ooyodo9.jpg","kind":"design","desc":"同じようなデザインの小型蓋ですが、蓋を開ける引掛けの形がちょっと違いますね。"}],"point":[34.40305,135.79895],"bbox":[135.7395,34.3771,135.8584,34.429],"geom":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[135.77184,34.37993],[135.78691,34.37936],[135.7985,34.38553],[135.81801,34.38735],[135.84333,34.3932],[135.85799,34.40584],[135.85839,34.41546],[135.84676,34.42896],[135.83045,34.42661],[135.81779,34.41264],[135.81249,34.42233],[135.78189,34.41781],[135.76542,34.42034],[135.7485,34.40643],[135.73952,34.40256],[135.74278,34.38932],[135.7568,34.38532],[135.75923,34.37711],[135.77184,34.37993]]]]}},{"id":"3e8c19e397","name":"葛城市","page":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/katuragi/katuragi.html","imgs":[{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/katuragi/1.jpg","kind":"emblem","desc":"葛城市 ・中央に葛城市市章。 上下に配した二つの円は旧新庄町と旧當麻町を表し、 二つの円が一つの市へと生まれ変わったことを表します。 下部の緑の部分は葛城山系の山並みや緑に茂る葉を表し、豊かな自然を守っていきたいという願いが込められています。 上部に赤い円を配し、全体で花が咲いたように見立て、菊やぼたんの花が咲く、うるおいのあるやさしいまちであることを表しています。 さらに、大空に大きく手をかかげたようにも見える造形は、葛城市が輝く未来"},{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/katuragi/katuragisi4.jpg","kind":"design","desc":"規格蓋です。「雨水」と表記がある雨水管マンホール蓋です。"},{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/katuragi/taimatyou.jpg","kind":"design","desc":"旧當麻町（たいまちょう） ・二上山と當麻寺の東塔と西塔に旧當麻町の花のボタンが描かれている。 「たいま」「げすい」の表示。 マークは旧當麻町の町章。（写真はノンカラー版）"}],"point":[34.50025,135.70909999999998],"bbox":[135.6675,34.4649,135.7507,34.5356],"geom":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[135.71447,34.51929],[135.69701,34.52498],[135.69559,34.53556],[135.6675,34.53086],[135.67693,34.52553],[135.67898,34.49306],[135.68481,34.4836],[135.68217,34.46487],[135.70241,34.46537],[135.72695,34.47356],[135.74107,34.47064],[135.75068,34.48167],[135.74679,34.49167],[135.73509,34.49157],[135.7302,34.51032],[135.7186,34.51025],[135.71447,34.51929]]]]}},{"id":"8d63605ec8","name":"河合町","page":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/kawai/kawai.html","imgs":[{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/kawai/kawai.jpg","kind":"emblem","desc":"六角形の規格マンホールでした。 町章は「河」の字をデザインしたものだそうです。"},{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/kawai/yamatoheiya.jpg","kind":"design","desc":"規格蓋に、「水」と「大和平野」の表示。 大和平野土地改良区管理の水道のマンホール蓋。"},{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/kawai/yamatoheiya2.jpg","kind":"design","desc":"同心円に「工」を並べた蓋に、「大和平野」の表示。 大和平野土地改良区管理のマンホール蓋。"}],"point":[34.57515,135.73264999999998],"bbox":[135.7121,34.5554,135.7532,34.5949],"geom":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[135.71571,34.59488],[135.7121,34.58244],[135.72704,34.57688],[135.72594,34.55544],[135.73828,34.55812],[135.73843,34.57649],[135.75255,34.57832],[135.75317,34.58058],[135.75163,34.59196],[135.74154,34.59318],[135.72686,34.59067],[135.71571,34.59488]]]]}},{"id":"eef25fbc6d","name":"川西町","page":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/kawanisi/kawanisi.html","imgs":[{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/kawanisi/kawanisi4.jpg","kind":"design","desc":"上記のノンカラー。向きは正しくありません。"},{"url":"https://we-love-manho.com/nara/kawanisi/kawanisi.jpg","kind":"emblem","desc":"毘沙門亀甲模様。 中央は川西町の町章です。"}],"point":[34.58855,135.773],"bbox":[135.7516,34.58,135.7944,34.5971],"geom":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[135.76751,34.59713],[135.75163,34.59196],[135.75317,34.58058],[135.78658,34.58004],[135.79438,34.58692],[135.7